            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Asinus clītellās portat et in clītellīs saccī sunt. The donkey carries a pack saddle, and on the pack saddle there are sacks."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "First declension, feminine plural: clītellae, clītellārum f. One thing, plural form."
